1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,600
Tvoje tijelo ima porodičnu

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,737
grupu na telefonu.

3
00:00:02,737 --> 00:00:03,408
I u njoj,

4
00:00:03,408 --> 00:00:04,545
jednog člana kojeg

5
00:00:04,545 --> 00:00:05,475
NIKO ne sluša.

6
00:00:05,675 --> 00:00:06,756
Grelin se javi prije

7
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,566
svakog obroka:

8
00:00:07,566 --> 00:00:08,737
„Ima li šta za jesti?“

9
00:00:08,937 --> 00:00:09,554
Inzulin,

10
00:00:09,554 --> 00:00:10,377
čim pojedeš:

11
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:11,302
„Šećer stigao,

12
00:00:11,302 --> 00:00:12,228
sve u ostavu!“

13
00:00:12,428 --> 00:00:13,725
Oksitocin šalje srca

14
00:00:13,725 --> 00:00:14,914
kad nekog zagrliš.

15
00:00:15,114 --> 00:00:16,599
A onda se iz crijeva

16
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:17,527
javi GLP-1:

17
00:00:17,527 --> 00:00:18,393
„Dosta je.

18
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,135
Sit si.“

19
00:00:19,335 --> 00:00:20,093
I tačno tad,

20
00:00:20,093 --> 00:00:20,519
nana:

21
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:20,993
„Jedi,

22
00:00:20,993 --> 00:00:21,419
jedi,

23
00:00:21,419 --> 00:00:22,224
kosti su ti!“

24
00:00:22,424 --> 00:00:24,153
A znaš šta je najgore?

25
00:00:24,153 --> 00:00:25,683
Tijelo GLP-1 obriše

26
00:00:25,683 --> 00:00:27,080
za samo 2 minute.

27
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,610
Poruka je obrisana.

28
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:30,170
Zato su naučnici napravili

29
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,167
peptid čija poruka

30
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:32,300
traje cijelu sedmicu:

31
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:32,980
semaglutid.

32
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:33,799
Grelin,

33
00:00:33,799 --> 00:00:34,473
inzulin,

34
00:00:34,473 --> 00:00:35,261
oksitocin,

35
00:00:35,261 --> 00:00:35,823
GLP-1:

36
00:00:35,823 --> 00:00:36,892
svi su peptidi.

37
00:00:36,892 --> 00:00:38,579
Kratki lanci aminokiselina

38
00:00:38,579 --> 00:00:39,816
koji šalju poruke.

39
00:00:40,016 --> 00:00:41,224
Pošalji ovo u svoju

40
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:42,275
porodičnu grupu.

41
00:00:42,275 --> 00:00:43,535
Da vidimo ko će prvi

42
00:00:43,535 --> 00:00:44,323
odgovoriti:

43
00:00:44,323 --> 00:00:44,849
„jedi,

44
00:00:44,849 --> 00:00:45,374
jedi“.

